      {
        "h_title": "Nai Harn Beach",
        "main_title": "Nai Harn Beach",
        "author": null,
        "language": null,
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Nai Harn Beach is situated north of Promthep Cape. There is a large freshwater lagoon inland near the beach. It is a popular beach for swimming and sun bathing. The beach is a stretch of sand and sea water with excellent quality. Near this beach, there is a little curved bay called Sane Bay. From May to October, it is recommended not to go swimming due to strong current.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Travelling to Nai Harn Beach",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Nai Harn Beach is 18 kms. from town. It is about 3 kms from Rawai beach. From Kata Beach, turn right at Kata Beach Resort and past the Boat House Wine& Grill. Take a left turn, go up the hill and follow the signs to Nai Harn Beach.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
